# Microsoft Clarity project id (session replay + heatmaps + geo).
# Analytics load ONLY when this is set — leave unset locally to keep dev clean.
# On Vercel: add this in Project Settings → Environment Variables,
# scoped to the Production environment only, so preview/dev traffic
# never gets recorded. Value is the id from clarity.microsoft.com.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLARITY_ID=

# Umami needs nothing here: its website id lives in app/components/Analytics.js,
# and it only records on the live domain (metadataBase in app/layout.js).
